{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the golden age of Formula racing through a modern 2.5D arcade experience.<br>Feel the thrill of cockpit-view driving, high-speed overtakes, and weather-changing drama \u2014 all inspired by classic arcade racers of the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for speed, nostalgia, and pure racing joy, this game combines pixel-shaded visuals with authentic racing tension \u2014 where every corner can define your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/ba946ad31c01d79f1f651b7eec3efed3.poster.avif?t=1762832241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/ba946ad31c01d79f1f651b7eec3efed3.webm?t=1762832241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/ba946ad31c01d79f1f651b7eec3efed3.mp4?t=1762832241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You know arcade graphics are cool... but what if we add more drama?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an arcade racer with cinematic intensity \u2014 cockpit raindrops, thunder-lit skies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/52c6f86d214451c3da90861b2fe8789e.poster.avif?t=1762832241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/52c6f86d214451c3da90861b2fe8789e.webm?t=1762832241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/52c6f86d214451c3da90861b2fe8789e.mp4?t=1762832241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience all weather\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sun-lit streets to midnight storms, the game\u2019s weather dynamically changes the racing mood and driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/b2d29e798241e15a4478cd490b41fec5.poster.avif?t=1762832241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/b2d29e798241e15a4478cd490b41fec5.webm?t=1762832241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/b2d29e798241e15a4478cd490b41fec5.mp4?t=1762832241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witness the evolution of Formula racing through four decades of speed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>four eras of iconic Formula 1 machines</strong> \u2014 from the fearless 1960s pioneers to the ground-effect monsters of the 1980s and the refined aero cars of the 1990s. <br>Current Demo Cars (80s Era) - Future Content (In Development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/cd8f52f754eb9fe91cb12442f5801694.poster.avif?t=1762832241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/cd8f52f754eb9fe91cb12442f5801694.webm?t=1762832241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"